WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:32.040
Everybody has an answer
Everybody knows the way

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:39.180
Every voice demands attention
Every fear has something to say

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:42.180
Turn this way
Run that direction

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:46.060
Hold this truth
Let that one go

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:56.720
But beneath all the talk
There’s a voice my heart still knows

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:01.080
When the words collide
When I lose the choice

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.040
I remember
I know Your voice

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:10.460
Through all the noise
I still hear You calling

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:14.880
Through all the fear
Your truth keeps breaking through

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:19.380
When every voice
Is pulling me in circles

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:23.640
I know the sound
I know the sound of You

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:31.320
Through all the noise
I still hear You calling

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:42.260
